></svg></a></article><article><h3>Confidence around bullying</h3><p>Respect, consideration and controlled partner practice are part of training. Karate can be a way to work on confidence; it is not a guarantee against bullying or a replacement for support from a school or trusted adult.</p><a class="editorial-link" href="<?php echo esc_url(home_url('/contact')); ?>" data-discover="true">Talk to us about your child <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-move-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 8L22 12L18 16"></path><path d="M2 12H22"></path></svg></a></article><article><h3>Fitness and flexibility</h3><p>Warm-ups, repeated techniques and movement practice make training an active part of your week. Start at your own level and tell your instructor about any limitations before joining in.</p><a class="editorial-link" href="<?php echo esc_url(home_url('/adult-karate')); ?>" data-discover="true">Explore adult training <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-move-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 8L22 12L18 16"></path><path d="M2 12H22"></path></svg></a></article><article><h3>Coordination and balance</h3><p>Stances, footwork and sequences of techniques give you a chance to practise moving with control. You learn one step at a time; you do not need to get everything right on your first visit.</p><a class="editorial-link" href="<?php echo esc_url(home_url('/beginners')); ?>" data-discover="true">What your first class involves <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-move-right" aria-hidden="